 <figcaption id="r28-views-title"><span>Figure 1</span> A read can cross the purchase boundary</figcaption>
 <div class="view-grid"><div><strong>Before purchase</strong><p>A: P7 stock 1</p><p>B: order 103 absent</p></div><div><strong>After purchase</strong><p>A: P7 stock 0</p><p>B: order 103 pending</p></div></div>
 <div class="mixed"><strong>Two independently current queries</strong><p>First A’s old stock 1 → then B’s new order 103</p></div>
